{
  "id": "section-skills",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skills\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,919,926]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Initial Skills: Your character begins\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,926,964]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with TWO Skills. Choose them from\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,964,998]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the following list. These initial Skills\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,998,1039]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are free, so ignore the XP cost in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1039,1074]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "parentheses after the Skill’s name.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1074,1110]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The costs are used for Skills learned\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1110,1148]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "during the game. All Skills have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1148,1183]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Basic and an Expert version. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1183,1216]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may not have Expert Skills at the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1216,1250]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "beginning of the game. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1250,1281]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "learn the Expert version only if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1281,1318]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "already know the basic version.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1318,1350]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skills may be added at any moment\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1350,1384]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in the game, paying their XP cost.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1384,1419]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Agile (8 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1419,1432]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 to your Defense rolls and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1432,1465]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls performed to climb, jump, or\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1465,1500]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "avoid danger.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1500,1514]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: Add +2 to the above.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1514,1543]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The bonus to Defense rolls does not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1543,1579]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stack with the bonus from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1579,1609]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Dodge Skill. Use one or the other.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1609,1644]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Bow (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1644,1655]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Ignore the -1 to hit with a bow that\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1655,1692]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "an unskilled character would have.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1692,1727]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "If you take this Skill at character\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1727,1763]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creation, you also automatically\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1763,1796]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have a bow and d6+3 arrows in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1796,1826]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "addition to other equipment.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1826,1855]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: +1 to Attack rolls with a bow.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[12,1855,1893]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Charisma (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,22,38]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have +1 to Charisma rolls (rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,38,75]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to persuade someone).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,75,97]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: +2 to Charisma rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,97,127]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Danger Sense (4 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,127,147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some monsters have a chance to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,147,178]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "take you by surprise. This is\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,178,208]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "expressed as a number out of 6,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,208,240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "such as “the ghost has a 3 in 6\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,240,272]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance of surprising you”. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,272,306]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have Danger Sense, you reduce this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,306,341]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance by 1. For example, a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,341,369]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "monster with a 3 in 6 chance will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,369,403]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have only a 2 in 6 chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,403,432]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprising you. Monsters with a 1\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,432,466]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in 6 chance of surprise have no\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,466,498]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "chance to surprise you if you have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,498,533]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Danger Sense.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,533,547]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: reduce the chance of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,547,576]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "surprise by 2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,576,591]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Dodge (4 xp)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,591,604]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have +1 to Defense rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,604,634]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "However, if you roll a 1 on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,634,664]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense roll, you lose your balance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,664,700]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and have -1 to your next Attack roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,700,737]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in the current combat.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,737,760]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: You have +2 to Defense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,760,791]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls, but you still lose your balance\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,791,830]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "when you roll a 1 on a Defense roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,830,867]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The bonus from Dodge does not\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,867,897]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "stack with the bonus from the Agile\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,897,933]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill. Use one or the other.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,933,962]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Faith (2 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,962,975]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may attempt to turn vampires\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,975,1008]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a holy symbol. It works like the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1008,1046]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Exorcism Arcane Skill (see p.17).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1046,1080]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0067",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You automatically begin the game\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1080,1113]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0068",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a holy symbol if you take this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1113,1149]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0069",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill at character creation. If you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1149,1185]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0070",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "learn it during the game, you must\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1185,1220]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0071",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "find a holy symbol BEFORE you can\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1220,1254]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0072",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "use this Skill.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1254,1270]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0073",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: Your attempt is at +1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1270,1301]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0074",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Fighter (6 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1301,1316]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0075",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 to Attack rolls when using\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1316,1350]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0076",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "hand-to-hand weapons. This is in\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1350,1383]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0077",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "addition to any bonuses the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1383,1411]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0078",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapon itself might have.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1411,1437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0079",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: Your attacks are at +2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1437,1469]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0080",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Good SHOT (8 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1469,1486]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0081",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 to Attack rolls with ranged\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1486,1521]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0082",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "weapons. This is in addition to any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1521,1557]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0083",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bonuses the weapon itself might\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1557,1589]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0084",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1589,1595]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0085",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: Your ranged Attacks are at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1595,1630]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0086",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "+2.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[13,1630,1633]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0087",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Investigator (6 xp)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,22,42]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0088",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 to your Search rolls. Reduce\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,42,78]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0089",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "by 1 the Clue cost of any game\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,78,109]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0090",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "effect that is paid in Clues, to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,109,144]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0091",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "minimum of 1. A result of 1 on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,144,177]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0092",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Search roll remains a 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,177,202]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0093",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: Add +2 to your Search rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,202,239]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0094",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Reduce Clue costs by 2 to a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,239,267]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0095",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "minimum of 1. A result of 1 on a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,267,300]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0096",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Search roll remains a 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,300,325]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0097",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Medic (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,325,338]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0098",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "After any encounter, you may use\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,338,371]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0099",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "up to 3 points from a first aid kit to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,371,410]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0100",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "heal up to 3 Life points. A character\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,410,448]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0101",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "with a first aid kit and no Medic Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,448,488]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0102",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may heal a single Life point.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,488,518]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0103",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: As above, but you may heal\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,518,553]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0104",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "up to 4 Life.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,553,567]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0105",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Occultist (4 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,567,584]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0106",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have +1 to any Magic roll.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,584,615]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0107",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: You have +2 to Magic rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,615,651]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0108",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Resilient (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,651,668]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0109",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Add +1 to saves versus poison,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,668,699]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0110",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "infection, or disease.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,699,722]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0111",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: You have +2 on such saves.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,722,757]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0112",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Resistant To Hunger (2 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[14,757,784]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-skills:p0113",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You need to consume 1 Food every\n",
